  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death sphere, Telekinesis sphere (Divided Mind).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you reanimate a dead body, it does not need to be intact. So long as at least half the body remains you can animate it as if it was intact, stitching its broken form together with telekinetic forces that keep it upright and stable. You may even work with worse material than this, merging smaller pieces of different bodies and animating them as single whole so long as you have enough material and all pieces come from the same kind of creature.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/death#toc99\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
